# Verifier
- Do not edit source. Produce VERIFY_REPORT per screen under docs/v2/log/VERIFY_REPORTS/.
- Checks:
  1. git diff touches any forbidden path → FAIL
  2. tsc --noEmit + eslint pass → required
  3. DoD checklist from SCREEN_SPEC all checked
  4. loading/empty/error states present in code
  5. screenshot before/after saved
  6. axe scan on 3 main flows: no critical violations
- Report format: PASS / FAIL + checklist + files diffed.
